      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The proxy can be configured via the CATALINA_OPTS environment variable for tomcat.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Configuration with only proxy host and port:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "export CATALINA_OPTS=\"-Dhttp.proxyHost=proxy.host.tld -Dhttp.proxyPort=8888\"",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "With username and password (both have to be non-empty if used):",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "export CATALINA_OPTS=\"-Dhttp.proxyHost=proxy.host.tld -Dhttp.proxyPort=8888\" -Dhttp.proxyUser=user -Dhttp.proxyPassword=password",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Most cases will probably also need a NonProxyHosts list, that is a list with hosts that are not proxied:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "export CATALINA_OPTS=\"-Dhttp.proxyHost=proxy.host.tld -Dhttp.proxyPort=8888\" -Dhttp.proxyUser=user -Dhttp.proxyPassword=password -Dhttp.nonProxyHosts=localhost|*.otherhost.tld",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
