     "body": "<p>The proxy can be configured via the CATALINA_OPTS environment variable for tomcat.</p>\n\n<p>Configuration with only proxy host and port:<br/>\nexport CATALINA_OPTS=\"-Dhttp.proxyHost=proxy.host.tld -Dhttp.proxyPort=8888\"</p>\n\n<p>With username and password (both have to be non-empty if used):<br/>\nexport CATALINA_OPTS=\"-Dhttp.proxyHost=proxy.host.tld -Dhttp.proxyPort=8888\" -Dhttp.proxyUser=user -Dhttp.proxyPassword=password</p>\n\n<p>Most cases will probably also need a NonProxyHosts list, that is a list with hosts that are not proxied:<br/>\nexport CATALINA_OPTS=\"-Dhttp.proxyHost=proxy.host.tld -Dhttp.proxyPort=8888\" -Dhttp.proxyUser=user -Dhttp.proxyPassword=password -Dhttp.nonProxyHosts=localhost|*.otherhost.tld</p>\n\n",
     "created": "19/Nov/09 10:20 AM",
